# .understandignore — patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
# Owner-approved full repository analysis (2026-09-18).
# Includes source, tests, docs, scripts, and build/deployment configuration.
# Developer knowledge only: no production data or generated dependencies.
!.github/workflows/**
!tests/**
!docs/**

# Safety exclusions override all inclusions, including future changes.
**/.env*
# Keep credential-management SOURCE CODE; exclude secret material, not modules.
